- Consider all return paths within the method
- If the method calls other methods, do not assume their return values unless their full declarations are provided
- Exception paths should not be considered null returns (exceptions are not null values)
- If the method's return value depends on a parameter, evaluate based on the actual argument passed at this call site
- Request declarations of any methods whose return values directly or indirectly impact this method's return value

